      "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1>: JULIANA, extremely pale white skin, angular face, crimson lips, long straight jet-black hair with small white beads at the crown, long silver dagger-shaped earrings, a deep purple long-sleeved gown with a plunging neckline and hip-high slits. Seen in <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 2>: NEKRON, pale skin, long white hair, a dark purple robe. Seen in <Picture 3>, <Picture 4>.\n<Picture 1>: a still of JULIANA. Anchors identity only. Do not import the pose or the action from this still.\n<Picture 2>: a still of JULIANA. Anchors identity only. Do not import the pose or the action from this still.\n<Picture 3>: a still of NEKRON. Anchors identity only. Do not import the pose or the action from this still.\n<Picture 4>: a still of NEKRON. Anchors identity only. Do not import the pose or the action from this still.\n\nsummary: reference generation + audio reference\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 3]): attribute_transfer \u2014 retains the traits listed above.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): attribute_transfer \u2014 retains the traits listed above.\n\ndetailed_description: rotoscope painted animation, Ice Peak throne hall. Cool cavern light, painted backgrounds, inked figures.\n[Shot 1] (0.0s) medium, three-quarter angle, static. The pale woman in the purple gown stands and looks up, a slight smile. <Subject 1> says, <d>[English] You have done well, my son.</d> <Subject 1> says, <d>[English] The North Village has fallen. We have won.</d>\n[Shot 2] (5.3s) medium, straight-on, static. The white-haired man lowers his hand from his face. <Subject 2> says, <d>[English] I want to thank you, Mother.</d>\n[Shot 3] (9.7s) medium, three-quarter angle, static. The pale woman in the purple gown gestures, then crosses her arms. <Subject 2> (off-screen) says, <d>[English] The Great Plain is all that stands between ourselves and Fire Keep.</d>\n\noverall_soundscape: cavernous hall reverb, distant wind. No music under the dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: cold, sinister theme.\n"
